    "Palaeocarpinus joffrensis Sun/Stockey1992 is a fruiting organ with paired fruits and individually bilobed bracts, not a parent tree.",
    "Proterocladus antiquus Tang2020 is a microscopic asymmetric multilevel filament; this is labeled enlarged closed relief. General-view cellular constrictions are subtle, and fresh QA must judge sufficient readability. Supplementary exact r002 cell closeup shows actual geometry, not replacement final views."
  ],
